WEBVTT

02:07:43.250 --> 02:07:44.792
They won't spare me
anyway once they identify me.

02:07:45.334 --> 02:07:47.000
What were you planning on doing then?

02:07:48.417 --> 02:07:49.750
Whoever that guy is,

02:07:49.917 --> 02:07:51.875
in a way he helped us a lot, sir.

02:07:52.084 --> 02:07:53.125
Even if we don't find him,
